(text "FE80/FE81 USB | FD20-FD23 Ethernet | FD10 mouse\nFD14 RTC data (low nibble), FD15 RTC index" (at 130 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f4150da1-8801-56ce-b89e-79b60251537c"))
(text "J1 pin 40 BUSRESET differs from pin 41 RESET.\nJ2 uses the reference parallel CH376 module on a short cable.\nIts USB host socket is on the module, not this carrier." (at 23 166 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cd1c5fa3-9f6f-535c-9020-c0bd1a795f9c"))
(text "JP1 selects the board supply; never bridge all three pins.\nExternal input: regulated 5V only; common CPC ground. Power CPC before external board supply.\nCheck power budget before selecting CPC power; external 5V is preferred for USB-drive bring-up." (at 20 187 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d608862a-41be-5615-800f-6a00d296382b"))
